@targets 1.21..26.3 Snapshot 3 (pre loot table rewrite)
@changes predicates, loot tables and advancements

Reverts to the old loot function/condition field names:
`"type"` -> `"function"` (on loot functions)
`"type"` -> `"condition"` (on predicates)
`"modifier"` -> `"functions"` (on loot pool entries)

Restores the implicit `minecraft:all_of`:
`"player": {...}` -> `"player": [{...}]` (advancement conditions)
